[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524848097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99349#issuecomment-2524848097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99349","id":2524848097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wfh_h","user":{"login":"MeowcaTheoRange","id":58280776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjgwNzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58280776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange","html_url":"https://github.com/MeowcaTheoRange","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MeowcaTheoRange/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-07T03:43:47Z","updated_at":"2024-12-07T03:44:05Z","body":"Having the same problem with my project. I'm building an editor and it's a PITA when the user changes the selected TreeItem when the SpinBox is focused, since it's programmed to change the SpinBox when the Tree's selected index is changed. It also doesn't change the SpinBox value at all if it's focused.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524848097/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525184933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99349#issuecomment-2525184933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99349","id":2525184933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wg0Ol","user":{"login":"Sloyd","id":32439089,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDM5MDg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32439089?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd","html_url":"https://github.com/Sloyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-07T14:17:37Z","updated_at":"2024-12-14T15:15:44Z","body":"It has something to do with the focus being released.\nIn general SpinBox is pretty broken, I think I'll write a proposal to change how it works.\n1. Spinbox FocusMode does nothing.\n2. It doesnt fire a `ValueChanged` signal when you go about your business (like when you click somewhere else while the Spinbox is focused)\n    I think every editing elemets like SpinBox or LineEdit and so on should lose focus when you click anywhere outside of them.\n4. It has this bug that it fires a `ValueChanged` signal when the focus is released from its `LineEdit`\n5. It should lose focus after submit\n6. If `update_on_text_change` is true, editing the text becomes impossible. You cannot delete all digits. you cannot write the minus character. You cannot write the dot character. If maxvalue was exceeded, and you try to select all and rewrite the value, the text doesnt change.. and many more..\n\nI've managed to reproduce this bug even without a `Tree`:\nIf you call `_spinBox.GetLineEdit().ReleaseFocus()` then call `SetValueNoSignal`, it will fire the broken `ValueChanged` signal.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525184933/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2556713975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99349#issuecomment-2556713975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99349","id":2556713975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YZFv3","user":{"login":"Sloyd","id":32439089,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDM5MDg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32439089?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd","html_url":"https://github.com/Sloyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sloyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-20T10:27:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-20T10:27:41Z","body":"> Having the same problem with my project. \n\nIf your project is in C#, I created an alternative that look exactly like a SpinBox, works exactly like a Spinbox, but with none of the problems:\n\n[spinner.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18209277/spinner.zip)\n\nI dont think it will be hard to translate the scripts to gdscript even..","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2556713975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816577521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99349#issuecomment-2816577521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99349","id":2816577521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4Y_x","user":{"login":"basicer","id":671513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MTUxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/671513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer","html_url":"https://github.com/basicer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basicer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T06:57:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T06:57:21Z","body":"I tried the minimal reproduction project in Godot 4.4.1 and it worked like I would expect.\n\nClicking the arrows and typing in a new value logs to console.\nClicking on the tree view updates the value but dose not log.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816577521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]